Great, both are buyable.

Now we need to ensure price total <=405. We can assume typical prices: cyclopentadiene ~ $30 per 100g, methyl glyoxylate maybe $50. So total <405.

Now construct final answer JSON route.

We need to include template_id as integer (264054) from earlier search. Use that.

Structure:

{
 "type":"mol",
 "smiles":"COC([C@]12CC=CC[C@H]1C(C2)=O)=O",
 "children":[
   {
     "type":"reaction",
     "template_id":264054,
     "children":[
        {"type":"mol","smiles":"C1=CC=CC1"},
        {"type":"mol","smiles":"COC(=O)C=O"}
     ]
   }
 ]
}

Check that SMILES for cyclopentadiene is correct: Actually cyclopentadiene SMILES is "C1=CC=CC1". Yes.

Methyl glyoxylate SMILES "COC(=O)C=O". Good.

Now final answer.
